WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
What a boring service visit looks like.

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:11.000
Booked ahead.
You know the date and time well before the day.

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:16.000
10:00. Signed in at reception, straight to work.

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:23.000
First, the panel and the log book.
Power, batteries, fault history.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:31.000
Detectors and call points tested. Sounders checked.

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:39.000
One detector past its best.
Explained before we leave. Quoted before it’s fixed.

00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:44.000
Covers back on. Nothing left behind.

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:51.000
Certificate and log book entry, in your portal.

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:56.000
Your business carries on, around the clock.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Keep it boring. Book a survey.
